<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - VeriFone a PaineWebber buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - VeriFone a PaineWebber buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber analyst Jim Preissler said he initiated coverage of VeriFone Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Set earnings per share estimates of $1.80 in 1997 and $2.20 in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Stock was up 5/8 at 32-1/2.</p>
</text>
